#, no-wrap
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:8
msgid ""
"代码里 **`notification*`** 指 **Inbox（收件箱）**；瞬时提醒使用 **`alert*`** "
"命名空间（`shell-sdk/alert`），二者概念分离。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inbox（收件箱）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:12 docs/concepts/notifications.md:64
msgid ""
"PG-backed in-app inbox for **user** and **agent** subjects (entity model). "
"Cron results, task due reminders, and LLM tools write here; Shell UI lists "
"and marks read via SAP."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alert（本机提醒，本机-only）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "**不走 Habitat RPC、不写 PG、不跨设备同步。** 各 shell 端在启动时注册 `AlertBackend`（web / desktop / mobile）。Feature 通过 `shell-sdk/alert` 使用**当前设备**系统通知通道。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:18
msgid "Alert 分两档（同一契约，成对）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 档         | API                                           | 含义                             |\n"
"| ---------- | --------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n"
"| **即时**   | `deliverAlert` / `AlertBackend.show`          | 现在立刻弹                       |\n"
"| **预登记** | `scheduleLocalAlert` / `cancelScheduledAlert` | 在未来时刻本机弹；**必须可取消** |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:25
msgid ""
"硬约束：**schedule ⊕ cancel 成对**。只登记不能取消 = 不可用（暂停/手动中止后"
"仍会到点骚扰）。同 `tag` 再 `schedule` = replace（先 cancel 再登记）；"
"`cancel` 对不存在的 id/tag **幂等成功**。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "**不是** Habitat 后台进程 / Inbox。任务到期「inbox→本机弹」可后续复用同一 `schedule` API。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "三壳 durability"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 壳          | `scheduleDurability` | 预登记存活边界                                            |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **mobile**  | `os`                 | 杀进程后 OS 仍可按 `at` 弹出（Local Notifications）       |\n"
"| **desktop** | `process`            | 应用未退出（托盘存活）即可；关主窗口仍响；`quit` 后不保证 |\n"
"| **web**     | `process`（页进程）  | **best-effort**：标签页存活才准；关标签即丢               |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "番茄钟"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "**例外（Habitat 同步，非 Alert）**：运行中活跃态（`pomodoro_active` + `pomodoro.active.*`）跨端 **last-write-wins**；**阶段结束系统通知仍仅本机**。多端同步靠 `put` / `clear` 后的 `pomodoro.active.changed`；重连与页面可见时 `active.get` 兜底，**不作周期轮询**。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:41
msgid ""
"阶段开始 / 继续时 `scheduleLocalAlert`（`phaseEndsAt`）；暂停、**手动取消进行"
"中会话**（`runPhaseAbort`）、阶段完成等路径 `cancelScheduledAlert`。状态机推"
"进仍由 `PomodoroShellWatcher`（或重开后 catch-up）负责；预登记只保证提醒。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 事件                      | Inbox |               Alert               | SSOT                |\n"
"| ------------------------- | :---: | :-------------------------------: | ------------------- |\n"
"| 任务到期/提醒             |   ✓   | 可选（后续：本机读 inbox 后弹窗） | `task_item` + inbox |\n"
"| Agent `notification_send` |   ✓   |               可选                | inbox               |\n"
"| Chat 新消息               |   ✗   |             ✓（后续）             | `conversation`      |\n"
"| 番茄钟阶段结束            |   ✗   |      ✓（预登记 + 即时兜底）       | `pomodoro_session`  |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:50
msgid ""
"番茄钟阶段结束**不写 inbox**；会话历史由 `pomodoro_session` entity 承担。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:52
msgid "实现：`src/frontend/shell-sdk/alert/` + 各端 backend。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 端          | 即时通道                                                 | 预登记                                                                |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **desktop** | Tauri 桌面通知（`showNativeAlert`） | Tauri schedule / cancel |\n"
"| **web**     | Web Notification API                                     | 页内 `setTimeout`（best-effort）                                      |\n"
"| **mobile**  | Tauri Android 本地通知（`showNativeAlert`）              | schedule / cancel                                                    |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:62
msgid "（以下为 Inbox 专章，保留原行为说明。）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recipients"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:68
msgid ""
"Subject entity ids are bound at Habitat boot into **`ResolvedWorldContext`** "
"and persisted to `hub_runtime_config.worlds` (see [`entity-model.md`](entity-"
"model.md)). Operators do **not** need to hand-maintain these ids on a new "
"instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:70
msgid "Optional override (advanced; rarely needed):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# hub_runtime_config (Shell → Habitat 服务设置 → worlds)，或冷启动后由 boot 自动回写\n"
"worlds:\n"
"  user_subject_id: 109 # type=user entity\n"
"  agent_subject_id: 110 # type=agent entity\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:79
msgid ""
"Legacy `notifications.user_subject_id` / `agent_subject_id` are still read "
"as fallback when `worlds` is unset."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:81
msgid ""
"`user_world_id` / `agent_world_id` are derived at Habitat boot from each "
"subject's `default_private_world_id`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:83
msgid ""
"Each row stores `recipient_kind` (`user` | `agent`) and `recipient_id` "
"(entity id string from `ResolvedWorldContext`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Writer                                  | Typical recipient                            |\n"
"| --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Cron success (when `notify_on_success`) | **both** user + agent                        |\n"
"| Cron failure                            | **both** user + agent                        |\n"
"| Task due reminder                       | user                                         |\n"
"| Env/health baseline change              | **both** user + agent (`builtin-env-health`) |\n"
"| `notification_send` tool                | user / agent / both; optional `subject_id`   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:93
msgid "Dream pipeline **does not** create notifications (reminder removed)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent consciousness"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:97
msgid ""
"Unread agent notifications are injected at inference time via a runtime-only "
"**`assistant(name=notification_context)`** turn immediately before the last "
"`user` message. They are **not** persisted in conversation messages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:99
msgid ""
"The inject block includes a **Handling protocol** (three-way triage by "
"whether action is needed — not by `source_kind`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent handling protocol"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:103
msgid ""
"For each injected `[id:…]` line, classify by content (not by writer/source):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:109
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Category                          | Action                          | Mark read                                       |\n"
"| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Informational only**            | Acknowledge in reply if useful  | Batch `notification_mark_read({ ids: [...] })`  |\n"
"| **Action needed, quick**          | Handle within ~3 tool rounds    | `notification_mark_read` that id after done     |\n"
"| **Action needed, slow/uncertain** | Ask the user before a long task | Do **not** mark read until approved and handled |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:111
msgid ""
"Unmarked unread items are re-injected on the next user turn. Use "
"`notification_list(recipient=agent, read_filter=unread)` if the inject block "
"is truncated."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "LLM tools (ToolSet `notification`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:115
msgid "Load via `toolset_load` with `notification`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:121
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool                     | Scope parameter                                                          |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `notification_send`      | Optional `subject_id` (overrides `target`); default `target=both`        |\n"
"| `notification_list`      | Optional `subject_id` (overrides `recipient`); default `recipient=agent` |\n"
"| `notification_mark_read` | Notification id only (global)                                            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:123
msgid ""
"`subject_id` must be the configured `user_subject_id` or `agent_subject_id` "
"from system prompt / `ResolvedWorldContext`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:124
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task reminder scan"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:127
msgid ""
"Builtin cron `builtin-task-reminders` runs **every minute** (`* * * * *`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:129
msgid "For each pending `task_item`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:133
msgid "**Trigger time**: `remind_at` if set, else `due_at`; if neither, skip."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:133
msgid ""
"**Send** when `trigger <= now` and `last_notified_at` is absent or "
"`last_notified_at < trigger` (entity JSONB field on schedulable body)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:133
msgid ""
"**After send**: patch `last_notified_at` on the task entity; do not rely on "
"day-based `source_ref` dedup alone."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Product rule (confirmed)**: one trigger per task per scan — **remind first, else due**; not separate notifications for both when both are set.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:137
msgid ""
"Task reminders are delivered to the **user** inbox via cron (Shell UI / "
"SAP), not injected into agent context and not duplicated by "
"`notification_send`."
msgstr ""

